  "description": "<h3><a name=\"Thisticketdependson%C2%A0https%3A%2F%2Fjira.duraspace.org%2Fbrowse%2FFCREPO2877%C2%A0%C2%A0beingcompletedfirst.\"></a><b>This ticket depends on <a href=\"https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2877\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2877</a>   being completed first.</b></h3>\n\n<p>When retrieving a memento with SMTs omitted,  the results should mirror the Original Resource.</p>\n\n<p>create versioned resource</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\ncurl -X POST -H <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Link: &lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//mementoweb.org/ns#OriginalResource&gt;; rel=\\\"</span>type\\<span class=\"code-quote\">\"\" http://localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/ -H \"</span>slug: testxyz\" -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin</span></pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>create memento of versioned resource</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\ncurl -i -X POST -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/testxyz/fcr:versions;</span></pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>Get the original resource without SMTs</p>\n\n<p> </p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\ncurl -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/testxyz -H <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Prefer: <span class=\"code-keyword\">return</span>=representation; omit=\\\"</span>http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#ServerManaged\\\"\"</span>\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>No triples should be returned.</p>\n\n<p>Get the memento without SMTs</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\n curl -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/testxyz/fcr:versions/20181001231451 -H <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Prefer: <span class=\"code-keyword\">return</span>=representation; omit=\\\"</span>http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#ServerManaged\\\"\"  </span></pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>Notice some SMTs are returned: </p>\n\n<p> </p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\n&lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/testxyz2&gt;  \r\n</span>                            rdf:type ldp:RDFSource ; \r\n                            rdf:type ldp:Container ; \r\n                            rdf:type ldp:BasicContainer .\r\n\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p> </p>\n\n<p>The task at hand it to ensure that the SMTs are suppressed in exactly the same way as they are in the Original Resource.</p>",
